# `@sonaraem/db-ops`

## When to use

| Change type | Where |
|---|---|
| DDL (CREATE/ALTER/DROP, indexes, new columns) | Drizzle — `pnpm db:generate` + `pnpm db:migrate` in `@sonaraem/db` |
| DML (backfills, data fixes, seeds for prod) | `@sonaraem/db-ops` |
| Dev-only utilities (reset, nuke, local seed) | `packages/db/scripts/` |

**Never** add new hand-written SQL data migrations to `packages/db/src/migrations/`.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm db:ops:generate my-fix-name   # scaffold YYYYMMDDHHmmss-my-fix-name.ts
pnpm db:ops:migrate                # run pending/failed ops (local + prod CI)
pnpm db:ops:migrate -- --dry-run --only my-fix   # test without writes or ledger
pnpm db:ops:status                 # show ledger vs migration files
```

Prod CI runs `db:ops:migrate` after `db:migrate` in `.github/workflows/drizzle-migrate.yml`.

## Migration file contract

- Path: `packages/db-ops/src/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHmmss-kebab-name.ts`
- Export: `export async function up({ db, log, dryRun }: DbOpsContext): Promise<void>`
- **dryRun** — when true, read + log only; return before any insert/update/delete
- Use Drizzle + `@sonaraem/common` helpers — no duplicated business logic
- **Idempotent** — safe if retried after a crash before ledger marks `completed`
- **No schema DDL** — required columns must exist via Drizzle migration first
- **Batch large backfills** — avoid Neon timeouts
- **Never edit** a migration after it is `completed` in prod (checksum guard fails CI)

## Ledger (`sonaraem_db_ops`)

Runner bootstraps the table. States: `running` → `completed` | `failed`.

- `completed` — skipped on all future runs
- `failed` — retried on next `db:ops:migrate`
- `running` &lt; 30 min — CI aborts (another run may be in progress)
- `running` ≥ 30 min — treated as stale crash, retried

Manual escape hatch (rare): `UPDATE sonaraem_db_ops SET status = 'failed' WHERE name = '...'` then re-run workflow.

## Local dev

`pnpm db:reset` truncates `sonaraem_db_ops` so ops migrations re-run on a fresh local DB. Drizzle schema history (`drizzle.__drizzle_migrations`) is unchanged.
